Notes

`libpaddle_ocr.so` is a combined work that statically links opencv-mobile and Clipper, dynamically
links the NDK's `libomp.so` and `libc++_shared.so`, and **dynamically loads** ONNX Runtime at
runtime (`dlopen`, per ONNX Runtime's ABI-stable C API) rather than linking it. OpenCV and Clipper
symbols are hidden (`-Wl,--exclude-libs,ALL`); only the three JNI entry points are exported.
`libonnxruntime.so` is redistributed unmodified; it links only `libc/libdl/liblog/libandroid/libm`.

Chimahon's GPL-3.0 `paddle-ocr.zip` release is **not** used, redistributed or derived from. The
consumer application (`:core:ocr`) is GPL-3.0-or-later as a whole; this artifact is Apache-2.0.
